<title>FINLAND: FINVEST SEES 1996 PROFIT BELOW FORECAST.</title>
<headline>FINVEST SEES 1996 PROFIT BELOW FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish consulting and capacitor group Finvest Oy said on Thursday its 1996 profits would be lower than forecast in its January-August report.</p>
<p>&quot;The weakening of the profits are due to a stamp duty to be paid by Interbank Osakepankki and liabilities for Metalex GmbH,&quot; Finvest said in a statement.</p>
